# Accepted IaC findings for the local learning stacks (trivy config --ignorefile).
# Every entry says why; anything new fails the pipeline.

# Public, plain-HTTP ALB: it is the app's front door; there is no ACM certificate locally.
# On real AWS: HTTPS listener with an ACM cert and an HTTP→HTTPS redirect.
AWS-0053
AWS-0054

# Unrestricted egress: instances run apt and download the AWS CLI; tasks pull from ECR.
# On real AWS: VPC endpoints (S3, ECR, Secrets Manager, Logs) and narrow egress.
AWS-0104

# False positives: both stages block public access with aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block
# (classic-ec2 via for_each, which the scanner does not resolve).
AWS-0086
AWS-0087
AWS-0091
AWS-0093

# Root volume encryption is a dynamic block, on when var.on_floci = false (real AWS); the
# scanner evaluates the Floci default. Floci has no EBS root volume to encrypt.
AWS-0131

# S3 uses default SSE-S3 encryption; customer-managed KMS keys are out of scope here.
AWS-0132

# ECR tags are mutable so a local `-dirty` tag can be rebuilt and pushed again.
# CI uses unique commit tags.
AWS-0031

# The baked EC2 "AMI" image runs systemd as PID 1, which needs root (like a real VM).
DS-0002

# EKS public API endpoint: kubectl runs from your machine. It is limited to
# var.kubectl_allowed_cidrs. On real AWS: private endpoint only, reached via VPN/bastion/SSM.
AWS-0040

# serverless: the viewer protocol is `allow-all` only when var.on_floci is true (plain http://plant.localhost
# locally). With on_floci=false it is `redirect-to-https`; the scanner reads the default value.
AWS-0012

# serverless: no AWS WAF in front of CloudFront. Floci does not emulate WAF and it costs money on AWS.
# For production attach an aws_wafv2_web_acl (managed rule groups, rate limiting).
AWS-0011

# gcp/cloud-run: Cloud SQL TLS and private address. database.tf enforces both (ssl_mode ENCRYPTED_ONLY,
# optional private_network) when var.on_floci is false; the scanner reads the default (true), and the
# emulator only serves plain TCP on a container address.
GCP-0015
GCP-0017
